b.section('Billing acceptance checks')
b.bullets('Repeated generation request, duplicate webhook and repeated capture settle only once.','Provider failure before acceptance releases the correct hold; ambiguous submission does not spawn an unrelated second task.','Partial success captures the supported partial amount and returns the rest.','Plan downgrade preserves work, constrains excess brands/limits and does not reassign the billing owner.','Monthly and annual plans receive grants on the correct windows; expiry and rollover consume the correct source buckets.','Refund/clawback is idempotent and cannot manufacture a spendable negative/duplicate grant.','Coming-soon add-ons cannot enter checkout as working products; required price mappings are present before sale.','Viewer and unauthorized workspace requests cannot spend even with billing mode off or shadow.')
